  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kosovo-Denmark Partnership for Green and Just Energy Transition (Inception Phase, Danish Energy Agency)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this engagement by the Danish Energy Agency is, through an inception phase to map a detailed assessment of the potential for a government to government programme, in order to explore the areas of Danish expertise and experience that are most relevant to Kosovo&#x2019;s green and just energy transition, incl. DEA&#x2019;s role within this engagement. A proposed project is to be formulated for technical assistance to Kosovan energy institutions, potentially through e.g. the Danish Energy Agency, and to be funded under the Kosovo-Denmark Partnership for Green and Just Energy Transition&#x201d;.</narrative>
  </description>
